WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:01.688
You already know React.

00:01.938 --> 00:04.428
The biggest shift in Vue is
how state changes propagate.

00:07.800 --> 00:09.672
React renders with a state snapshot.

00:09.922 --> 00:13.745
Vue tracks reactive reads and updates
the effects that depend on them.

00:16.800 --> 00:18.282
A ref holds a mutable value.

00:18.532 --> 00:22.137
In script, access dot value;
top-level refs unwrap in templates.

00:25.300 --> 00:27.203
Use computed for pure derived state.

00:27.453 --> 00:30.583
Use watch for side effects,
and clean up stale requests.

00:33.800 --> 00:36.782
Props, events, and slots
define component contracts.

00:37.032 --> 00:40.557
Composables share behavior; Pinia
can manage shared client state.

00:42.300 --> 00:45.137
Named slots are like children
and element props in React.

00:45.387 --> 00:47.862
The parent chooses content;
the child owns layout.

00:51.300 --> 00:53.283
Scoped slots resemble render props.

00:53.533 --> 00:57.230
The list handles iteration while its
consumer chooses how each item appears.

01:00.300 --> 01:02.893
Composables reuse reactive
behavior without markup.

01:03.143 --> 01:07.313
Separate calls create independent state
when that state lives inside the function.

01:09.300 --> 01:11.610
Compound components can
use provide and inject.

01:11.860 --> 01:15.221
Keep state ownership explicit
and expose actions for updates.

01:17.800 --> 01:20.785
Compose entity display and
feature actions in a higher layer.

01:21.035 --> 01:23.655
The task card should not depend
on the completion feature.

01:27.800 --> 01:30.029
Feature-Sliced Design applies to Vue too.

01:30.279 --> 01:35.068
Organize by responsibility and expose
public APIs rather than importing internal

01:35.068 --> 01:35.427
files.

01:36.800 --> 01:39.517
Across slices, dependencies
point to lower layers.

01:39.767 --> 01:42.270
A page or widget coordinates
sibling features.

01:44.300 --> 01:45.211
Start small.

01:45.461 --> 01:50.038
Extract features when behavior is reused,
and keep one-page behavior local until a

01:50.038 --> 01:51.378
useful boundary emerges.

01:54.800 --> 01:58.623
Build a small task app, then add routing,
tests, and performance profiling.

01:58.873 --> 02:00.899
The accompanying blog explains each step.
